        "title": "Scoped memory controls in the Agent Info panel",
        "summary": "Agents can now read, write, and surface memories scoped to a specific project, with the routing wired end-to-end from the interface down through the harness memory proxy and self-improvement handlers.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Reworked the Memory tab in the Agent Info panel with a substantially expanded UI and preview surface so users can browse and manage memories scoped to the current project rather than a single global bucket.",
