            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Threaded project_id through the agent chat routes, installed-tools context, and the harness memory proxy so memory reads/writes and tool endpoints carry the active project scope instead of defaulting to agent-wide state.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "c2e74a64fa58af5e1e6301fcd8c100a484326ec5"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Self-improvement proposals now accept a project_id query parameter and append it to the propose endpoint, so learning suggestions are attributed to the project they originated from.",
